{"id":"1801844690","kind":"answer","title":"为什么会有人考不上一本？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2021-03-27","updated":"2021-03-27","votes":34,"comment_count":3,"minutes":1,"chars":556,"keywords":["学习动机","自由学习","学习内驱力","教育改革","自主学习"],"summary":"数据来源： 国家数据 2019 年高中毕业人数 789 万 2019 年本科生招生人数 431 万 如果要回答为什么有人考不上一本，答案很简单：萝卜太多，坑太少。 而且，为了筛选出这些人，不知道牺牲了多少学生对学习的热爱： 叶峻峣：5 Effect of schooling on the learn drive 学校对学习内驱…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/368659250/answer/1801844690","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"x7FgEohb\">数据来源：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://data.stats.gov.cn/easyquery.htm?cn=C01\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">国家数据</a></p><p data-pid=\"KK7S4j-4\">2019 年高中毕业人数 789 万</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-aa4f523613ed013e59131aeef7d98de7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2556e6ed3c930e8f73f9d5ee2b504f81\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0bd6404aed7149e4d4b60d91fcc526f0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1051\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-aa4f523613ed013e59131aeef7d98de7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2556e6ed3c930e8f73f9d5ee2b504f81\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-0bd6404aed7149e4d4b60d91fcc526f0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1051\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"zzLXhO7B\">2019 年本科生招生人数 431 万</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c8a28bb60a5638d07edee50993f4dc91_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-cc591b6abadeb26fa61eade4b7cf18b2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c2b348a175c0e5845e586920c9125f15_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1041\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c8a28bb60a5638d07edee50993f4dc91_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-cc591b6abadeb26fa61eade4b7cf18b2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c2b348a175c0e5845e586920c9125f15_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1041\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"WcF0ZYfI\">如果要回答为什么有人考不上一本，答案很简单：萝卜太多，坑太少。</p><p data-pid=\"hUmKHHUU\">而且，为了筛选出这些人，不知道牺牲了多少学生对学习的热爱：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d05676373cb4e46309b2a3761a51d2a7_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"227\" data-image-width=\"754\" data-tm-id=\"52990626\" href=\"#/post/52990626\">叶峻峣：5 Effect of schooling on the learn drive 学校对学习内驱力的影响</a><blockquote data-pid=\"_LO8YMnY\">学校之所以失败，是因为它们不尊重并抑制了关于学习、创造力和解决问题的基本机制。作为负责促进科学的机构来说，学校对大脑如何运作的基本原理一无所知，这是令人毛骨悚然的。</blockquote><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-98e9fc11170508519086fff0d580f9f5_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"556\" data-image-width=\"1326\" data-tm-id=\"65338937\" href=\"#/post/65338937\">叶峻峣：10 Why schools fail 为什么学校会失败</a><p data-pid=\"R0qvWYdJ\">这一切，大多是因为强迫学生去学习导致的：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-e432e5cd2bf2653a64d4297ef77cb59c_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"368\" data-image-width=\"500\" data-tm-id=\"351872034\" href=\"#/post/351872034\">叶峻峣：Coercion in learning 学习中的强迫</a><p data-pid=\"_HEbAcju\">只有遵循学习的基本规律，才能让学生快乐且高效地学习：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-67d42efda1879649d4a12b325ba09792_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"368\" data-image-width=\"500\" data-tm-id=\"273225977\" href=\"#/post/273225977\">叶峻峣：学习的基本规律</a><p data-pid=\"X2y55owK\">想要达成这一点，对于学生来说，我们要自由学习：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6b0c6d48d34f1e4d4ae44e8b3b7842b2_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"499\" data-image-width=\"750\" data-tm-id=\"272543239\" href=\"#/post/272543239\">叶峻峣：自由学习</a><p data-pid=\"exni7Rp8\">对于教育体系，需要改革：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-cf977a87fd02e754308f2efb72562668_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"722\" data-image-width=\"1897\" data-tm-id=\"242815901\" href=\"#/post/242815901\">叶峻峣：教育改革</a><p data-pid=\"6FKb9Y4K\">唯有如此，才能实现人的自由而全面的发展。</p><p data-pid=\"8tOdJBk6\">当然，现在的教育资源分布非常不均衡，想要解决这个问题，唯有发展生产力，特别是发展教育技术。为每一位学生提供充分的教育资源，是我们努力的目标：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-55597a63f29e994d220a58f8576def96_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"768\" data-image-width=\"1024\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/346567385\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：从国产 Anki 类软件说起，谈谈教育技术和内卷（暴论）</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"272543239","title":"自由学习","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":299,"minutes":4,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"242815901","title":"教育改革","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":265,"minutes":30,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"52990626","title":"5 学校对学习内驱力的影响","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":90,"minutes":18,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"351872034","title":"学习中的强迫","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":57,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"65338937","title":"10 为什么学校会失败？","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":33,"minutes":5,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"273225977","title":"学习的基本规律","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":137,"minutes":4,"reason":"本回答Level 2 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1949441047303258874","title":"为何阐释高效的教育体系如此之难？","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":62,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"52805512","title":"1 前言","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":137,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"631684134","title":"常见问题：教育改革基本法","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":41,"minutes":4,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"362420803","title":"凿壁上网","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":11,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"369391813","title":"成为优等生的危险","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":499,"minutes":32,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2018441984","title":"中办国办印发《关于进一步减轻义务教育阶段学生作业负担和校外培训负担的意见》，有哪些值得关注的信息？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":19,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 19 赞同"},{"id":"1701028559","title":"如何看待衡水二中学生反映学校寒假期间「要求高一学生早五晚十学习，开摄像头监控」，是否涉嫌侵犯学生权益?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":968,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 968 赞同"},{"id":"1714910279","title":"如果不考虑物质方面的因素，你觉得教育的形式应该是怎样的，它的真正目的又是什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 10 赞同"},{"id":"3029922725","title":"为什么，所有人都在骂应试教育，却没有人有实际的办法？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":310,"minutes":34,"reason":"相似问答 · 310 赞同"},{"id":"1926248931551088800","title":"假设把教育改革大权交到你手中，你将做点什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":142,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 142 赞同"}]}